  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB Wayfinder (Pacific) Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program will support private investment in the Pacific through the following: (i) a lending and guarantee envelope of up to $80 million from Ordinary Capital Resources (OCR) of the Asian Development Bank (ADB); (ii) grants and guarantees of up to $50 million from the Asian Development Fund (ADF) Private Sector Window (ADF-PSW) to be utilized for grants and guarantees; and (iii) technical assistance (TA) of up to $15 million from the Technical Assistance Special Fund (TASF).</narrative>
  </description>
