     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Development Objectives: The Wayfinder program will complement existing initiatives focusing on increasing ADB&apos;s direct support for private financing in the Pacific. It will support ADB&apos;s commitment to have special regard to the needs of the smaller or less developed member countries in the region while adhering to ADB&apos;s operating principles under the Agreement Establishing the Asian Development Bank (the Charter).</narrative>
